-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party assets
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT License above covers the source code and original content of this
repository. It does NOT cover the third-party assets listed below, which are
included under their own licences. Anyone reusing them must follow those
licences, including their attribution and share-alike terms where they apply.

1. Photographs in public/culture/

   Taken from Wikimedia Commons. Each image keeps the licence its author gave
   it on Commons (public domain, CC0, CC BY 2.0, CC BY 3.0, CC BY 4.0,
   CC BY-SA 3.0, CC BY-SA 3.0 PL or CC BY-SA 4.0). The author, licence and
   source page of every image are recorded next to it in
   src/content/culture.ts and shown under the image in the app. Where an
   image is licensed CC BY-SA, adaptations of that image must be shared under
   the same licence.

2. Pictures in public/pictures/

   From Twemoji (https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji), copyright Twitter, Inc
   and other contributors, licensed under CC BY 4.0
   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

3. Recorded voice in public/voice/

   Generated with the Piper text-to-speech voices pl_PL-mc_speech-medium and
   pl_PL-gosia-medium (https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices), whose
   training datasets are released under CC0. See each voice's model card for
   details.

4. Word frequency ordering in src/content/frequency.ts

   Ordered using the OpenSubtitles 2018 Polish list from
   hermitdave/FrequencyWords (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords),
   whose word lists are licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

5. Videos linked from the culture notes

   Embedded from YouTube (youtube-nocookie.com) and not included in this
   repository. They remain the property of their owners.

Any other third-party material that carries its own licence or copyright
notice is covered by that licence, not by the MIT License above.
